WEBVTT

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:36.900 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.950 line:0%
[Episode 8]

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.210 line:0%
[Lai's Mansion]

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:52.000 line:0%
The more you fight,

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:57.010 line:0%
the safer I am.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:58.720 line:0%
Where are you going?

00:01:58.720 --> 00:01:59.360 line:0%
Jia is sick.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.940 line:0%
He's been wanting his father to stay with him.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:02.020 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.800 line:0%
You always use

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.040 line:0%
Jia as an excuse.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.080 line:0%
Do you think I can't see through it?

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:06.720 line:0%
I won't allow you

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:07.740 line:0%
to go to your mistress!

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:08.900 line:0%
You shrew.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.600 line:0%
A jealous shrew!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.060 line:0%
Your life depends on me,

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:13.960 line:0%
and you dare to be so rude to me!

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:15.120 line:0%
Stop it!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.080 line:0%
Get away!

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.750 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:22.160 line:0%
The Grand Commander's wife is here!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.160 line:0%
You bitch.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.450 line:0%
You'll pay for this.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.320 line:0%
Move aside!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.430 line:0%
Stop gathering here!

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:29.480 line:0%
Leave us!

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:32.560 line:0%
Yijiao.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.700 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.760 line:0%
Did you come just to laugh at me?

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:38.010 line:0%
I...

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.000 line:0%
How could I?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:39.920 line:0%
You married into a noble family,

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.560 line:0%
so you're humiliating me.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.800 line:0%
I don't want your charity!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:43.850 line:0%
Go away!

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:55.200 line:0%
Yan Xing, scribe from the Ministry of Justice, step in and pay your respects!

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.000 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.240 line:0%
Mrs. Shen is here.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:12.280 line:0%
Greetings, Grand Empress Dowager.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.520 line:0%
No need for formalities.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.660 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, you've made contributions to the Buddha case.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.840 line:0%
I want to reward you with something.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.810 line:0%
But after thinking it over,

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.860 line:0%
I couldn't come up with anything.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.120 line:0%
Why don't you tell me yourself?

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.320 line:0%
What reward do you want?

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:33.879 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.120 line:0%
I don't want any reward.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.520 line:0%
However, with all due respect,

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:40.180 line:0%
I would like to request a verbal decree from you.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:43.720 line:0%
Very well.

00:03:44.879 --> 00:03:47.160 line:0%
I'm listening.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.680 line:0%
Your Majesty, what I request

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:56.040 line:0%
is that you address me as Miss Yan from now on,

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.360 line:0%
not Mrs. Shen.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.900 line:0%
At such a young age,

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:09.750 line:0%
you already possess such insight and ambition.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.720 line:0%
That's wonderful.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:14.400 line:0%
Our country selects capable talents

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.960 line:0%
without regard to gender.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:17.870 line:0%
Women can rely on their own abilities

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.280 line:0%
to forge a path,

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.199 line:0%
rather than depending

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.640 line:0%
on their husbands.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.050 line:0%
I grant you this.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.870 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.600 line:0%
With all due respect, I have something to say.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.480 line:0%
Although all six ministries have female officials,

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.400 line:0%
most are only

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.520 line:0%
responsible for cleaning and organizing.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.040 line:0%
For example, in the Ministry of Justice,

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:46.860 line:0%
female officials

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:49.920 line:0%
cannot investigate cases like their male colleagues.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.240 line:0%
You see...

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.440 line:0%
You see, I am also a woman.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.280 line:0%
I naturally understand

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.720 line:0%
how hard women must work

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:01.840 line:0%
to stand on equal footing

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.520 line:0%
with men.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:05.320 line:0%
I can sit

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.360 line:0%
in this position,

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.280 line:0%
and female officials

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.960 line:0%
can also investigate cases.

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:13.880 line:0%
Madam Xu,

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.920 line:0%
draft an imperial decree for me.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:16.720 line:0%
From now on,

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.960 line:0%
female officials in the six ministries

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.120 line:0%
will have

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.080 line:0%
the same rights as male officials.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.460 line:0%
Your Majesty, you're wise and enlightened.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:27.920 line:0%
Miss Yan,

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.060 line:0%
from now on,

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:31.520 line:0%
you can

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.840 line:0%
investigate cases freely,

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:36.160 line:0%
just like your male colleagues.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.910 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:45.440 line:0%
Sixth Lady.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:48.430 line:0%
Xu?

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.860 line:0%
Is your director here?

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.880 line:0%
Our director has been feeling unwell these past few days

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.420 line:0%
and took leave to rest at home.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:57.950 line:0%
Is there something urgent?

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.560 line:0%
It's not exactly urgent.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:02.440 line:0%
It's just a bit shocking.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:03.720 line:0%
How so?

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.080 line:0%
Before, regarding Liang Chenzhong's

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.400 line:0%
chronic poisoning,

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.200 line:0%
you asked me to start investigating

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.330 line:0%
Water Dropwort from those around him.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.240 line:0%
I followed the trail and investigated thoroughly.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.840 line:0%
Guess who I traced it back to?

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.220 line:0%
It actually led to the owner of Tongming House,

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:19.740 line:0%
Rong Zhui.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.720 line:0%
Don't move!

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:30.600 line:0%
Behave yourself!

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:33.820 line:0%
Water Dropwort?

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:35.680 line:0%
Take her away.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.500 line:0%
Go!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.920 line:0%
I brought some supplements for your mother.

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.250 line:0%
The one below is for you.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.240 line:0%
You suffered unjust imprisonment.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.100 line:0%
You've lost quite a bit of weight.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.380 line:0%
Thank you for your care, Shen.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.680 line:0%
I didn't suffer much

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:30.210 line:0%
at the hands of the jailers.

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:32.400 line:0%
And the cell was quiet.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.530 line:0%
It actually gave me time to think of

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.800 line:0%
many ways to improve siege weapons.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:42.920 line:0%
I know

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.880 line:0%
that turning myself in was foolish.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.080 line:0%
But my mother has suffered too much.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.000 line:0%
I thought that no matter what,

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.930 line:0%
I couldn't let her suffer any more.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.440 line:0%
Thank you again

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:52.840 line:0%
for uncovering the truth

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.360 line:0%
and restoring the Liang family's name.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.720 line:0%
Although the Buddha case has been closed,

00:07:58.720 --> 00:07:59.960 line:0%
the person who used Water Dropwort to poison

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:01.220 line:0%
hasn't been found yet.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:02.250 line:0%
The Liang family

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.290 line:0%
can't be considered completely innocent.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.360 line:0%
So...

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.730 line:0%
So you're still planning to arrest my mother?

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.280 line:0%
On what grounds are you arresting me?

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:11.880 line:0%
Take him away.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:12.880 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.520 line:0%
It was Xu Xiangren and Madam

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.520 line:0%
who took people to arrest Liang Jiren.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:17.960 line:0%
They investigated Tongming House?

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:18.720 line:0%
Yes.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.040 line:0%
Before that, they had already

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:20.920 line:0%
captured Rong Zhui,

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:22.520 line:0%
the owner of Tongming House.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.970 line:0%
They really acted fast.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.420 line:0%
Should I take people

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:28.800 line:0%
to stop them?

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:30.920 line:0%
No need.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:34.440 line:0%
She was just granted the authority to investigate cases.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.130 line:0%
Let her show off a bit.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:37.950 line:0%
Yes.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.620 line:0%
Third Young Master Liang,

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:53.800 line:0%
recently,

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.440 line:0%
I've been frequently visiting Liang's Mansion.

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:58.680 line:0%
In addition to assisting the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.480 line:0%
I have my own reasons.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.480 line:0%
Now, everything I wanted to investigate

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.040 line:0%
has already been clarified,

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.900 line:0%
and the people I needed to capture

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.350 line:0%
have already been arrested by someone on my behalf.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.370 line:0%
The dragon has nine sons,

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.100 line:0%
each with their own character.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:17.680 line:0%
Water Dropwort

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:19.360 line:0%
has nothing to do with you and your mother.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.340 line:0%
The second branch of the Liang family

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.270 line:0%
should not be lumped together with the first branch.

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:26.680 line:0%
Focus on your duties.

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.080 line:0%
Don't disappoint

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.880 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager's expectations of you.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.720 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.240 line:0%
Was it you who poisoned Liang Chenzhong

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.760 line:0%
with Water Dropwort?

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:55.960 line:0%
That's right.

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.280 line:0%
It was me.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.640 line:0%
His eldest son

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.390 line:0%
is nothing but a scoundrel!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.800 line:0%
If he hadn't died,

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:10.830 line:0%
he would eventually

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:12.330 line:0%
cause his father's death.

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.610 line:0%
Besides,

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.480 line:0%
I was already carrying his father's child.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.560 line:0%
Naturally, I had to plan for the future.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:35.430 line:0%
Sir,

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:36.720 line:0%
this way, please.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.400 line:0%
We have a new batch of dancing girls.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.160 line:0%
Would you like me to call them over

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.160 line:0%
so you can choose one?

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.070 line:0%
So thoughtful.

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:44.160 line:0%
Good.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.180 line:0%
Mr. Liang,

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:45.960 line:0%
I found

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.500 line:0%
a new beauty for you.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:47.900 line:0%
[Liang Chenzhong]

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:49.600 line:0%
Lan,

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:50.600 line:0%
come over here.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:51.600 line:0%
Beautiful.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:53.560 line:0%
-Come here.
-Sir.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.000 line:0%
Mr. Liang,

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.280 line:0%
please have some tea.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.330 line:0%
I had no choice.

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.300 line:0%
That unfilial son

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.140 line:0%
was either gambling

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:09.940 line:0%
or spending recklessly at pleasure houses.

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.850 line:0%
When he ran out of money,

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.640 line:0%
he came to threaten me, his father,

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:14.570 line:0%
to give him more.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.780 line:0%
He's nearly emptied our family's coffers.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.610 line:0%
If it weren't for this,

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:22.010 line:0%
I wouldn't have come to this point.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:22.970 line:0%
Besides,

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:25.480 line:0%
I have

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.960 line:0%
an unborn child.

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:28.990 line:0%
I should

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.600 line:0%
make plans for him too, shouldn't I?

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.430 line:0%
So,

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:53.960 line:0%
because of the unborn child Rong Zhui was pregnant with,

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.000 line:0%
he decided

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:55.840 line:0%
to cruelly abandon

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.080 line:0%
his eldest son.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:58.360 line:0%
Indeed.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.360 line:0%
I've been a constable for so long,

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.620 line:0%
and I've seen all kinds of strange cases.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:03.900 line:0%
But I've never heard of

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:07.430 line:0%
a father intentionally poisoning

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.000 line:0%
his own eldest son.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:11.280 line:0%
Who would have thought that

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:13.520 line:0%
someone would actually hurt their own child?

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:14.320 line:0%
Human nature

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.400 line:0%
is truly the most mysterious thing.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:57.640 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:59.280 line:0%
what brings you here?

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:03.750 line:0%
Commander Liang, have you forgotten

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.200 line:0%
that the Buddha case

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.200 line:0%
has been entrusted entirely to me

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.860 line:0%
by the Grand Empress Dowager?

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.020 line:0%
Your iron-handed methods

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:16.130 line:0%
actually greatly surprised me.

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.880 line:0%
If I had a second option,

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.230 line:0%
I wouldn't have resorted to this.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.690 line:0%
I had no choice.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.400 line:0%
They say even a tiger wouldn't eat its own cubs.

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:35.040 line:0%
But when it comes to you,

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.560 line:0%
you just say

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.560 line:0%
you had no choice?

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.000 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:45.250 line:0%
why are you mocking me?

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:50.960 line:0%
I did murder my own child.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:52.530 line:0%
But what about you?

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.780 line:0%
You reported your own father.

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.760 line:0%
You and I are clearly the same kind of person.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.160 line:0%
Among the charges

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.760 line:0%
against my father back then,

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.320 line:0%
one of them accused him

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.240 line:0%
of stealing a weapon blueprint

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.240 line:0%
and leaking it to the enemy country.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.730 line:0%
That weapon blueprint

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.330 line:0%
was drawn by your younger brother.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.750 line:0%
I knew it.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.600 line:0%
You and my stupid nephew

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.310 line:0%
are always hanging out together.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.350 line:0%
I thought you were just being courteous

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:40.850 line:0%
and a close friend

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.530 line:0%
of my foolish nephew.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.580 line:0%
Turns out,

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.580 line:0%
you're suspecting the Liang family.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:15:02.980 line:0%
[In Mourning]

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:01.920 line:0%
Gosh,

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.140 line:0%
why are you here?

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.300 line:0%
Why are you here at this time?

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.660 line:0%
I'm here to see you.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:08.340 line:0%
Did anyone see you?

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.560 line:0%
I don't know.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.360 line:0%
If someone saw you, it would be trouble.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.760 line:0%
At a time like this, you're still worried about these things?

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.920 line:0%
Your precious son

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.630 line:0%
must have known something,

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.770 line:0%
which is why you decided to kill him

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.840 line:0%
to silence him.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.800 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.080 line:0%
if you truly had found something out,

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.300 line:0%
I'm sure

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:36.590 line:0%
you wouldn't have come to ask me.

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:38.160 line:0%
Even if this matter

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:41.840 line:0%
reaches the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:43.920 line:0%
I

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:47.180 line:0%
will still claim ignorance.

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:52.270 line:0%
So, it seems that

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.280 line:0%
your care

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:55.760 line:0%
for your unborn child

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.360 line:0%
is also fake.

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:06.260 line:0%
If you

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.560 line:0%
promise me

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.040 line:0%
to look after my unborn child in the future,

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:18.840 line:0%
I'm willing to try and recall something.

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:19.840 line:0%
Perhaps,

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:22.560 line:0%
I might remember something.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:30.160 line:0%
You don't have the right

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.400 line:0%
to make conditions with me.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:42.680 line:0%
Have you ever heard of a punishment

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:45.510 line:0%
in the Imperial Security Bureau called "tearing inch by inch?"

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:46.790 line:0%
With each cut,

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.040 line:0%
the prisoner loses

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.600 line:0%
exactly 36 drops of blood.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:51.250 line:0%
Within 3 days,

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.660 line:0%
the prisoner will be cut 360 times

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.370 line:0%
but won't die.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.460 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:01.370 line:0%
I am an official of the court.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.350 line:0%
I just attempted to kill my own child!

00:17:08.619 --> 00:17:09.419 line:0%
And...

00:17:10.869 --> 00:17:12.409 line:0%
And I was an accomplice.

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:14.240 line:0%
My crime does not warrant death.

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:18.360 line:0%
You...

00:17:18.899 --> 00:17:21.010 line:0%
You... you can't act recklessly.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:23.760 line:0%
Recklessly?

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.840 line:0%
Commander Liang, do you really think

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.080 line:0%
my nickname, White Ghost,

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.410 line:0%
was earned for nothing?

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:38.620 line:0%
You've entered the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.280 line:0%
and you want to leave alive?

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.520 line:0%
You...

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:46.870 line:0%
You... How dare you!

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.850 line:0%
This is the first cut.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:01.250 line:0%
I have nothing else to do in these few days,

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.000 line:0%
so I'll keep you company for three days.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.540 line:0%
I'll tell you.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:12.880 line:0%
I'll tell you.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.050 line:0%
Back then, I got drunk

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:20.590 line:0%
and revealed the weapon blueprint of my second brother.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.960 line:0%
And I didn't dare

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:23.640 line:0%
to admit it afterward.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.770 line:0%
At that time, your father and my second brother

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.410 line:0%
were very close.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:29.720 line:0%
Besides,

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:32.680 line:0%
he had already been convicted of treason.

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:35.690 line:0%
So I just went along with it

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.100 line:0%
and pinned it on him.

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.800 line:0%
By accident, Chenzhong

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.440 line:0%
learned about this.

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:47.230 line:0%
So he kept blackmailing me for money.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:49.370 line:0%
I couldn't take it anymore.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.200 line:0%
I just couldn't take it anymore!

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:52.590 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.340 line:0%
back then, your father

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:58.120 line:0%
was firmly convicted of treason,

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.300 line:0%
with irrefutable evidence.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:02.750 line:0%
Even without this charge,

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:05.900 line:0%
he couldn't have had his case overturned.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.050 line:0%
So it really was you.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:29.050 line:0%
In that case, I will overturn each charge

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:31.550 line:0%
one by one.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:29.750 line:0%
I don't seek fame in future generations,

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:32.120 line:0%
only to remain true to my conscience

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.080 line:0%
and the common people.

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.070 line:0%
[Shen Bingzhu, Shen Du's Father]

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:37.790 line:0%
How could I collude with you?

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:40.720 line:0%
It's absolutely impossible.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.460 line:0%
Don't blame me for not warning you.

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.220 line:0%
The upright tree is the first to be cut down,

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.150 line:0%
and the well with the purest water is the first to run dry.

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:48.610 line:0%
If you don't align with me,

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.460 line:0%
you'll be walking into a perilous situation

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:54.760 line:0%
with no way out.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.690 line:0%
I live off the emperor's salary,

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:00.350 line:0%
so naturally, I should shoulder his burdens,

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:01.870 line:0%
even if I have to die.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.350 line:0%
In accordance with heaven's will and the times,

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:19.160 line:0%
I have received this clear mandate.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:21.160 line:0%
The guilty minister, Shen Bingzhu,

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.830 line:0%
secretly communicated with the enemy,

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:26.270 line:0%
burned our military grain storage,

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.640 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:29.110 line:0%
leaked our weapons blueprint,

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.010 line:0%
colluded with foreign powers,

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.000 line:0%
and betrayed his country.

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.440 line:0%
[Gao Youning, Shen Du's Mother]

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:35.310 line:0%
His crimes deserve the death penalty.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:38.400 line:0%
All male members of the Shen family will be executed in accordance with the law,

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.710 line:0%
and the women and children will be confined.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:44.160 line:0%
Let this be known to all.

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:50.230 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.040 line:0%
Father,

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:51.840 line:0%
all these years,

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.090 line:0%
I have never given up

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:57.590 line:0%
seeking justice for the Shen family.

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:01.660 line:0%
But who exactly is that woman?

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:05.010 line:0%
I still have no clue.

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:05.710 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:09.930 line:0%
Is she friend or foe?

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:12.280 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:22:15.570 --> 00:22:19.120 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:19.260 line:0%
No matter what,

00:22:21.010 --> 00:22:21.810 line:0%
today,

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:25.910 line:0%
I can at least prove

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:30.600 line:0%
that the accusation regarding the weapon blueprint was fabricated.

00:22:42.100 --> 00:22:43.540 line:0%
Father, rest assured.

00:22:44.640 --> 00:22:45.400 line:0%
I will

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:46.730 line:0%
find that woman one day.

00:22:47.650 --> 00:22:49.220 line:0%
And I will find

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:53.240 line:0%
all the remaining evidence

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:54.200 line:0%
one by one.

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:22.280 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:23:24.560 --> 00:23:25.450 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:26.920 line:0%
the celebration banquet of the Ministry of Justice and the constables

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:27.800 line:0%
is tonight.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:28.760 line:0%
What does that have to do with me?

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:29.960 line:0%
Grand Commander...

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:33.980 line:0%
You are absolutely right!

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:37.310 line:0%
Come on, come on.

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:38.440 line:0%
Come on, thanks for your hard work.

00:23:38.440 --> 00:23:39.700 line:0%
Drink this cup of wine.

00:23:39.700 --> 00:23:40.560 line:0%
Let me pour you another cup of wine.

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:41.760 line:0%
We won't leave until we're drunk.

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:42.630 line:0%
Can you handle it?

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:43.540 line:0%
Let's go over there.

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:44.600 line:0%
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:45.400 line:0%
Come on, Meng.

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:47.280 line:0%
I'd like to propose a toast to you.

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:48.240 line:0%
Eat.

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:52.820 line:0%
Thanks for your hard work.

00:23:54.140 --> 00:23:55.070 line:0%
Come on, come on.

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:01.080 line:0%
I almost forgot.

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:02.310 line:0%
Your letter.

00:24:02.350 --> 00:24:05.010 line:0%
This letter was sent to the Ministry of Justice.

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:10.750 line:0%
[If fate allows, we can meet in Xiang'an City, and you can choose the location.]

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:10.750 line:0%
[We should sit together and talk freely. Having a confidant in life is truly a great fortune.]

00:24:15.460 --> 00:24:16.950 line:0%
You seem so happy.

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:18.400 line:0%
Chi is coming to Xiang'an.

00:24:18.400 --> 00:24:19.800 line:0%
She asked to meet with me.

00:24:19.820 --> 00:24:21.080 line:0%
That's great!

00:24:21.630 --> 00:24:22.640 line:0%
I've heard you

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:23.520 line:0%
talk about this Chi

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:25.120 line:0%
so many times.

00:24:25.160 --> 00:24:27.320 line:0%
Back then, when the Ministry of Justice received

00:24:27.320 --> 00:24:29.840 line:0%
many self-recommending letters for investigative cases,

00:24:29.840 --> 00:24:31.680 line:0%
you were the only foolish one

00:24:31.680 --> 00:24:33.790 line:0%
who carefully read every single one of them.

00:24:33.790 --> 00:24:35.600 line:0%
I even laughed at you.

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:37.440 line:0%
Who would have thought that

00:24:37.440 --> 00:24:39.320 line:0%
you'd actually make such a close friend?

00:24:39.320 --> 00:24:41.560 line:0%
I'm so envious of you.

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:43.120 line:0%
I still remember

00:24:43.120 --> 00:24:43.760 line:0%
her first letter

00:24:43.760 --> 00:24:45.200 line:0%
from Jiangnan.

00:24:45.280 --> 00:24:47.200 line:0%
The stationery had a floral design

00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:48.480 line:0%
and smelled wonderful.

00:24:48.480 --> 00:24:51.340 line:0%
There were even flower petals inside the envelope.

00:24:52.320 --> 00:24:54.180 line:0%
I'm so jealous.

00:24:54.360 --> 00:24:56.400 line:0%
I really want to meet her myself.

00:24:56.790 --> 00:24:58.400 line:0%
Such a

00:24:58.400 --> 00:24:59.800 line:0%
talented girl

00:24:59.800 --> 00:25:01.240 line:0%
must be beautiful

00:25:01.240 --> 00:25:02.230 line:0%
Sorry, though.

00:25:02.320 --> 00:25:04.720 line:0%
She only asked to meet with me.

00:25:06.160 --> 00:25:07.110 line:0%
How annoying.

00:25:11.350 --> 00:25:13.320 line:0%
They can really drink, can't they?

00:25:14.070 --> 00:25:15.450 line:0%
-Let's eat.
-Let's eat grapes.

00:25:15.450 --> 00:25:16.490 line:0%
Here.

00:25:18.680 --> 00:25:19.480 line:0%
Sixth Lady.

00:25:19.960 --> 00:25:20.760 line:0%
Come on.

00:25:22.400 --> 00:25:23.160 line:0%
I truly admire

00:25:23.160 --> 00:25:24.720 line:0%
your skills in solving cases.

00:25:24.720 --> 00:25:25.560 line:0%
I'd like to

00:25:25.680 --> 00:25:26.940 line:0%
propose a toast to you.

00:25:27.520 --> 00:25:28.480 line:0%
Xu,

00:25:28.480 --> 00:25:30.140 line:0%
I'm not very good at drinking.

00:25:30.160 --> 00:25:30.960 line:0%
It's alright.

00:25:30.980 --> 00:25:33.120 line:0%
You'll get better at it as you drink more.

00:25:33.120 --> 00:25:34.560 line:0%
You'll gradually

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:36.800 line:0%
discover the mysteries of the wine.

00:25:38.440 --> 00:25:38.920 line:0%
Here.

00:25:44.190 --> 00:25:46.030 line:0%
I advise you to behave yourself.

00:25:53.170 --> 00:25:55.140 line:0%
Do you want to get caught again?

00:25:58.490 --> 00:26:00.000 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:26:00.260 --> 00:26:01.350 line:0%
Shen Du?

00:26:01.610 --> 00:26:02.910 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:26:14.800 --> 00:26:15.800 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:26:16.120 --> 00:26:17.180 line:0%
please have a seat.

00:26:22.840 --> 00:26:24.200 line:0%
Did I say not to come?

00:26:38.680 --> 00:26:39.680 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:26:39.700 --> 00:26:40.740 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:26:42.370 --> 00:26:43.850 line:0%
It's an honor

00:26:43.870 --> 00:26:45.340 line:0%
to have you here.

00:26:45.570 --> 00:26:47.430 line:0%
I'd like to propose a toast to you.

00:27:07.400 --> 00:27:08.740 line:0%
Please drink.

00:27:19.160 --> 00:27:20.440 line:0%
Here, Grand Commander,

00:27:20.440 --> 00:27:22.300 line:0%
I'd like to propose a toast to you.

00:27:31.730 --> 00:27:33.380 line:0%
I didn't expect

00:27:33.410 --> 00:27:36.470 line:0%
that the Grand Commander can handle his liquor so well.

00:27:52.720 --> 00:27:53.630 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:27:53.630 --> 00:27:55.490 line:0%
I'd like to propose a toast to you.

00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:12.800 line:0%
Come on.

00:28:17.500 --> 00:28:20.560 line:0%
Is this what you call being able to hold his liquor well?

00:28:22.240 --> 00:28:23.460 line:0%
I'm not drunk.

00:28:26.130 --> 00:28:27.260 line:0%
I'm perfectly fine.

00:28:28.760 --> 00:28:29.820 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:28:29.950 --> 00:28:32.210 line:0%
You're perfectly fine.

00:28:38.870 --> 00:28:40.070 line:0%
You don't believe me?

00:28:42.570 --> 00:28:44.410 line:0%
Find someone to fight me.

00:28:53.050 --> 00:28:54.720 line:0%
Now that you mention it,

00:28:55.160 --> 00:28:56.520 line:0%
there's actually someone

00:28:56.520 --> 00:28:57.580 line:0%
I'd like to beat up.

00:29:03.040 --> 00:29:03.840 line:0%
Let's do it!

00:29:16.180 --> 00:29:18.900 line:0%
Goodbye, Grand Commander.

00:29:25.200 --> 00:29:26.160 line:0%
Take care.

00:29:29.040 --> 00:29:29.840 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:29:30.800 --> 00:29:31.860 line:0%
light the lantern!

00:29:33.360 --> 00:29:34.860 line:0%
What lanterns?

00:29:36.440 --> 00:29:37.440 line:0%
Who carries a lantern

00:29:37.440 --> 00:29:38.500 line:0%
to beat someone up?

00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:41.200 line:0%
Let's go.

00:29:45.410 --> 00:29:46.450 line:0%
Beat someone up?

00:29:47.420 --> 00:29:48.220 line:0%
Okay.

00:29:49.430 --> 00:29:51.360 line:0%
But I can't do it without a lantern.

00:29:51.900 --> 00:29:53.550 line:0%
You can.

00:29:53.760 --> 00:29:54.600 line:0%
Look at me.

00:29:54.640 --> 00:29:56.040 line:0%
I'll be your lantern.

00:29:56.060 --> 00:29:57.120 line:0%
Let's go, let's go.

00:29:57.640 --> 00:29:58.440 line:0%
Jing Lin, let's go.

00:29:58.440 --> 00:29:59.120 line:0%
Let's go.

00:29:59.360 --> 00:30:00.240 line:0%
Let's go.

00:30:00.360 --> 00:30:01.440 line:0%
Come on.

00:30:01.640 --> 00:30:02.280 line:0%
Let's go.

00:30:03.000 --> 00:30:03.720 line:0%
Be careful.

00:30:03.720 --> 00:30:05.000 line:0%
Sixth Lady, take care.

00:30:06.480 --> 00:30:07.240 line:0%
Goodbye, Grand Commander.

00:30:07.240 --> 00:30:08.000 line:0%
Be careful.

00:30:08.560 --> 00:30:09.520 line:0%
-Be careful.
-Chuichui.

00:30:09.520 --> 00:30:10.560 line:0%
Come on. Let's keep drinking.

00:30:10.560 --> 00:30:11.600 line:0%
I'm not gonna drink with you.

00:30:11.600 --> 00:30:12.850 line:0%
I'm going to eat.

00:30:12.870 --> 00:30:14.200 line:0%
Be careful. Be careful.

00:30:48.250 --> 00:30:49.190 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:30:49.450 --> 00:30:50.280 line:0%
come and help

00:30:50.280 --> 00:30:51.540 line:0%
your Grand Commander.

00:30:52.520 --> 00:30:53.850 line:0%
He's too heavy.

00:31:03.680 --> 00:31:04.900 line:0%
Let's go.

00:31:05.390 --> 00:31:07.790 line:0%
Grand Commander, there are steps. Up we go.

00:31:08.930 --> 00:31:09.520 line:0%
Careful.

00:31:09.520 --> 00:31:10.460 line:0%
Here are some more steps.

00:31:10.460 --> 00:31:11.770 line:0%
Go.

00:31:11.800 --> 00:31:13.620 line:0%
Go.

00:31:17.880 --> 00:31:18.750 line:0%
Steady yourself.

00:31:18.750 --> 00:31:19.810 line:0%
Careful. Careful.

00:31:21.200 --> 00:31:22.000 line:0%
Who is it?

00:31:22.120 --> 00:31:22.920 line:0%
Come out!

00:31:22.960 --> 00:31:23.760 line:0%
Who is it?

00:31:29.200 --> 00:31:30.000 line:0%
Who is it?

00:31:30.720 --> 00:31:32.040 line:0%
Wait here for me.

00:31:32.040 --> 00:31:33.570 line:0%
I'm going to punch someone.

00:31:37.680 --> 00:31:38.520 line:0%
I'll do it.

00:31:40.240 --> 00:31:41.300 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:31:41.440 --> 00:31:42.400 line:0%
Go ahead.

00:31:48.870 --> 00:31:50.200 line:0%
Who are you? Who are you?

00:31:50.400 --> 00:31:51.000 line:0%
Come out!

00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:52.280 line:0%
He's so drunk.

00:31:54.960 --> 00:31:55.620 line:0%
Who're you?

00:31:58.200 --> 00:31:59.000 line:0%
Who're you?

00:31:59.240 --> 00:32:00.300 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:32:03.100 --> 00:32:04.530 line:0%
In the Buddha case,

00:32:04.550 --> 00:32:06.110 line:0%
she killed only the unfaithful.

00:32:06.110 --> 00:32:07.680 line:0%
So many unfaithful men and women

00:32:07.680 --> 00:32:09.400 line:0%
have been buried at Ximing Temple.

00:32:09.400 --> 00:32:11.440 line:0%
Yet someone still dares to covet a mistress

00:32:11.440 --> 00:32:13.370 line:0%
and neglect his wife and children.

00:32:14.230 --> 00:32:15.030 line:0%
This time,

00:32:15.880 --> 00:32:18.080 line:0%
it's just a small punishment to serve as a warning.

00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:19.680 line:0%
If you dare do it again,

00:32:19.720 --> 00:32:21.080 line:0%
I'll dig out your heart

00:32:21.080 --> 00:32:22.000 line:0%
and bury it in the ground.

00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:22.760 line:0%
I won't dare.

00:32:22.840 --> 00:32:24.200 line:0%
I won't dare! I'll never do it again!

00:32:24.200 --> 00:32:25.530 line:0%
I will never do it again.

00:32:28.640 --> 00:32:29.880 line:0%
I didn't expect White Ghost to be like this

00:32:29.880 --> 00:32:31.360 line:0%
when he's drunk.

00:32:32.480 --> 00:32:34.200 line:0%
Take your sober Grand Commander

00:32:34.200 --> 00:32:34.920 line:0%
back to the mansion.

00:32:34.920 --> 00:32:35.560 line:0%
Let's go.

00:32:37.440 --> 00:32:38.770 line:0%
-Be careful.
-Let's go.

00:32:43.350 --> 00:32:44.810 line:0%
-Be careful.
-Be careful.

00:32:55.810 --> 00:32:56.640 line:0%
Who were you?

00:32:56.640 --> 00:32:57.760 line:0%
You beat me so hard.

00:32:57.760 --> 00:32:58.520 line:0%
Who were you?

00:32:59.140 --> 00:33:00.100 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:33:06.520 --> 00:33:08.580 line:0%
I didn't expect the mighty White Ghost

00:33:08.580 --> 00:33:10.610 line:0%
to have such poor tolerance for alcohol.

00:33:10.610 --> 00:33:12.880 line:0%
Aren't you usually very capable?

00:33:14.120 --> 00:33:15.390 line:0%
Even a corpse

00:33:15.600 --> 00:33:17.160 line:0%
is easier to carry than you.

00:33:43.280 --> 00:33:44.480 line:0%
Thank you.

00:33:46.320 --> 00:33:47.370 line:0%
It's nothing.

00:33:47.560 --> 00:33:49.400 line:0%
Sending my drunk roommate back

00:33:49.400 --> 00:33:50.200 line:0%
isn't a big deal.

00:33:50.200 --> 00:33:51.260 line:0%
No need to thank me.

00:33:55.990 --> 00:33:57.180 line:0%
Prisoner's Center?

00:34:05.220 --> 00:34:10.930 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:34:15.539 --> 00:34:21.220 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:34:16.570 --> 00:34:18.160 line:0%
So you knew it all along.

00:34:21.499 --> 00:34:23.760 line:0%
I thought you had forgotten everything.

00:34:23.959 --> 00:34:27.340 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:34:28.180 --> 00:34:32.820 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:34:31.080 --> 00:34:32.410 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:34:34.039 --> 00:34:40.810 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:34:37.180 --> 00:34:38.120 line:0%
This is from

00:34:38.120 --> 00:34:40.289 line:0%
a new preserved fruit shop in the capital.

00:34:40.289 --> 00:34:41.289 line:0%
Who's over there?

00:34:41.430 --> 00:34:42.430 line:0%
I have to go now.

00:34:42.560 --> 00:34:44.519 line:0%
Tomorrow, I'll bring a comb to do your hair.

00:34:43.990 --> 00:34:47.370 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:34:48.269 --> 00:34:52.100 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:34:54.120 --> 00:34:57.780 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:34:55.240 --> 00:34:56.680 line:0%
This is very delicious.

00:34:56.700 --> 00:34:57.950 line:0%
Try it.

00:34:58.450 --> 00:35:02.570 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:34:59.870 --> 00:35:00.760 line:0%
Let her go!

00:35:00.760 --> 00:35:02.550 line:0%
-Let go of me!
-Let her go!

00:35:02.800 --> 00:35:03.720 line:0%
-Let her go!
-Brother Shen Du!

00:35:03.720 --> 00:35:04.520 line:0%
Let her go!

00:35:04.520 --> 00:35:05.560 line:0%
I will definitely find a way

00:35:04.640 --> 00:35:07.580 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:35:05.560 --> 00:35:06.680 line:0%
to get you out of here!

00:35:06.680 --> 00:35:08.080 line:0%
Wait for me!

00:35:08.670 --> 00:35:12.510 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:35:11.120 --> 00:35:13.360 line:0%
Madam Xu,

00:35:13.710 --> 00:35:18.310 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:35:16.710 --> 00:35:18.890 line:0%
thank you.

00:35:19.010 --> 00:35:21.620 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:35:23.400 --> 00:35:27.830 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:35:28.580 --> 00:35:30.960 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:35:32.920 --> 00:35:35.100 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:35:48.010 --> 00:35:49.350 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:35:49.830 --> 00:35:51.740 line:0%
You're so annoying!

00:36:21.760 --> 00:36:22.960 line:0%
Good morning, Madam.

00:36:24.280 --> 00:36:25.440 line:0%
Good morning, Madam.

00:36:25.440 --> 00:36:27.440 line:0%
Madam, please have your breakfast.

00:36:34.080 --> 00:36:34.880 line:0%
You...

00:36:36.240 --> 00:36:37.040 line:0%
Morning.

00:37:09.140 --> 00:37:12.200 line:0%
I behaved inappropriately last night after drinking.

00:37:41.480 --> 00:37:42.440 line:0%
It's alright.

00:37:55.520 --> 00:37:56.450 line:0%
Last night...

00:37:56.690 --> 00:37:57.900 line:0%
It's okay.

00:37:59.240 --> 00:38:00.220 line:0%
Miss.

00:38:00.640 --> 00:38:01.440 line:0%
Miss.

00:38:02.440 --> 00:38:03.700 line:0%
Qi Yeyun?

00:38:04.360 --> 00:38:05.160 line:0%
Miss.

00:38:07.160 --> 00:38:08.960 line:0%
What happened to your forehead?

00:38:12.560 --> 00:38:13.800 line:0%
Who hit you?

00:38:14.590 --> 00:38:15.540 line:0%
Was it you?

00:38:15.880 --> 00:38:16.780 line:0%
Did you hit my sister?

00:38:16.780 --> 00:38:17.830 line:0%
No, no.

00:38:18.610 --> 00:38:20.210 line:0%
I drank too much last night

00:38:21.960 --> 00:38:24.290 line:0%
and accidentally bumped into something.

00:38:26.070 --> 00:38:26.880 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:38:26.880 --> 00:38:28.080 line:0%
Why did you come to me?

00:38:28.840 --> 00:38:29.960 line:0%
I'm here to deliver something

00:38:29.960 --> 00:38:31.020 line:0%
for our Young Lady.

00:38:31.080 --> 00:38:32.640 line:0%
Your Young Lady?

00:38:33.080 --> 00:38:34.320 line:0%
It's Lu Chuichui.

00:38:34.440 --> 00:38:35.680 line:0%
This is the Hundred-flower Essence she has treasured

00:38:35.680 --> 00:38:36.540 line:0%
for many years.

00:38:37.080 --> 00:38:37.960 line:0%
Drinking it with water

00:38:37.960 --> 00:38:39.200 line:0%
can help relieve hangover headaches.

00:38:39.200 --> 00:38:40.520 line:0%
She specifically asked me to deliver it.

00:38:40.520 --> 00:38:42.050 line:0%
Chuichui is so thoughtful.

00:38:42.520 --> 00:38:45.180 line:0%
But when did you start working for the Lu family?

00:38:45.240 --> 00:38:46.680 line:0%
The old clerk at Lu's Pawn Shop

00:38:46.680 --> 00:38:48.400 line:0%
was fired for talking too much.

00:38:48.400 --> 00:38:50.200 line:0%
Now, they've hired me as the new clerk.

00:38:50.200 --> 00:38:51.120 line:0%
I thought to myself,

00:38:51.120 --> 00:38:52.160 line:0%
since you still don't want to accept me

00:38:52.160 --> 00:38:53.200 line:0%
as your apprentice

00:38:53.200 --> 00:38:54.040 line:0%
and I'm too young

00:38:54.040 --> 00:38:55.800 line:0%
to apply for a position in the Ministry of Justice,

00:38:55.800 --> 00:38:56.960 line:0%
working as a clerk

00:38:56.960 --> 00:38:57.760 line:0%
at your colleague's shop

00:38:57.760 --> 00:38:59.360 line:0%
would bring me closer to you.

00:38:59.760 --> 00:39:00.960 line:0%
You talk so much.

00:39:01.610 --> 00:39:02.440 line:0%
I think you'll end up

00:39:02.440 --> 00:39:04.080 line:0%
just like the last clerk.

00:39:04.440 --> 00:39:05.440 line:0%
How could that be?

00:39:05.600 --> 00:39:06.760 line:0%
I'm only talkative

00:39:06.760 --> 00:39:07.960 line:0%
in front of my sister.

00:39:12.120 --> 00:39:12.920 line:0%
Uncle Zhong.

00:39:17.530 --> 00:39:20.400 line:0%
Why do you let everyone into the mansion?

00:39:20.920 --> 00:39:21.720 line:0%
Why do you

00:39:21.720 --> 00:39:23.450 line:0%
let everyone into the mansion?

00:39:29.210 --> 00:39:29.540 line:0%
[Secrets of the Shen family]

00:39:29.850 --> 00:39:35.840 line:0%
[Information about Shen Du from the Shen Family]

00:39:32.400 --> 00:39:33.480 line:0%
On June 1st,

00:39:33.520 --> 00:39:35.360 line:0%
Shen Du was enraged because the pancake at breakfast

00:39:35.360 --> 00:39:36.280 line:0%
was too hard.

00:39:37.280 --> 00:39:38.080 line:0%
On June 2nd,

00:39:38.160 --> 00:39:40.080 line:0%
for dinner, we had cold noodles with locust leaves,

00:39:40.080 --> 00:39:41.610 line:0%
and Shen Du ate three bowls.

00:39:41.690 --> 00:39:42.720 line:0%
On June 3rd,

00:39:42.750 --> 00:39:45.040 line:0%
Shen Du was enraged because the tofu pudding at breakfast

00:39:45.040 --> 00:39:46.190 line:0%
was salty.

00:39:46.480 --> 00:39:47.400 line:0%
On June 4th,

00:39:47.560 --> 00:39:49.240 line:0%
all the preserved fruits in the mansion were consumed.

00:39:49.240 --> 00:39:50.510 line:0%
Shen Du was enraged.

00:39:50.960 --> 00:39:52.640 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:39:53.040 --> 00:39:54.000 line:0%
do you take me

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:56.200 line:0%
for a three-year-old?

00:39:55.220 --> 00:39:57.330 line:0%
[Secrets of the Shen family]

00:39:59.960 --> 00:40:00.960 line:0%
Your Excellency.

00:40:01.400 --> 00:40:03.120 line:0%
Has everything been taken care of in Yingzhou?

00:40:03.120 --> 00:40:04.080 line:0%
Yes.

00:40:04.640 --> 00:40:07.370 line:0%
The accounts from Yingzhou have been delivered.

00:40:07.820 --> 00:40:09.250 line:0%
[Transportation Account]

00:40:09.880 --> 00:40:12.340 line:0%
This year's revenue is nearly 30,000 taels.

00:40:12.670 --> 00:40:14.930 line:0%
[Imported: 500 catties of wool, 300 catties of woolen cloth]

00:40:15.870 --> 00:40:17.920 line:0%
This must be kept confidential.

00:40:20.620 --> 00:40:22.020 line:0%
Even Prince Xian

00:40:22.050 --> 00:40:23.780 line:0%
cannot know.

00:40:23.810 --> 00:40:25.040 line:0%
Rest assured, Your Excellency.

00:40:25.040 --> 00:40:25.760 line:0%
This

00:40:25.760 --> 00:40:27.670 line:0%
will be kept under wraps.

00:40:28.370 --> 00:40:29.170 line:0%
Also,

00:40:29.200 --> 00:40:29.840 line:0%
I've

00:40:29.840 --> 00:40:31.740 line:0%
taken care of the noble families that have shown support

00:40:31.740 --> 00:40:33.270 line:0%
for Prince Xian.

00:40:33.440 --> 00:40:34.680 line:0%
They've received benefits,

00:40:34.680 --> 00:40:35.480 line:0%
so they will naturally

00:40:35.480 --> 00:40:37.000 line:0%
keep absolutely quiet,

00:40:37.020 --> 00:40:38.620 line:0%
and there won't be any leaks.

00:40:40.690 --> 00:40:42.770 line:0%
Liang Jiren

00:40:43.710 --> 00:40:45.110 line:0%
can't keep secrets.

00:40:45.690 --> 00:40:47.500 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:40:47.670 --> 00:40:50.200 line:0%
might secretly send him into exile this time.

00:40:51.690 --> 00:40:53.560 line:0%
Find an opportunity

00:40:53.970 --> 00:40:55.700 line:0%
to silence him forever.

00:40:56.240 --> 00:40:57.960 line:0%
He knows too much.

00:41:00.120 --> 00:41:00.840 line:0%
Cheng Cai.

00:41:00.840 --> 00:41:01.480 line:0%
Here.

00:41:02.040 --> 00:41:03.280 line:0%
Zhang Xinliang.

00:41:03.280 --> 00:41:03.920 line:0%
Here.

00:41:04.880 --> 00:41:05.680 line:0%
Song...

00:41:12.080 --> 00:41:13.880 line:0%
Isn't this the wife of the Grand Commander?

00:41:13.880 --> 00:41:15.000 line:0%
What happened?

00:41:22.680 --> 00:41:23.840 line:0%
Madam,

00:41:23.840 --> 00:41:25.840 line:0%
you're here to clock in personally?

00:41:27.930 --> 00:41:28.730 line:0%
Yan Xing!

00:41:29.640 --> 00:41:30.440 line:0%
Here.

00:41:33.920 --> 00:41:35.180 line:0%
How did you get

00:41:35.210 --> 00:41:36.350 line:0%
all these injuries?

00:41:42.210 --> 00:41:43.530 line:0%
I accidentally fell.